# robonix/system/scene/goal_clear - whether a navigation goal a plan already
# holds is still a pose the robot can stand at: its footprint fits there on
# the map, and Navigation's costmap, which marks what the robot's sensors see
# now, does not mark it. goal_region and goal_near choose a goal; this checks
# one.

geometry_msgs/PoseStamped goal
---
bool clear
# Why not, when clear is false.
string reason
